first_claim:
An OMESFET comprising:
 a substrate; 
 an organic semiconductor contacting said substrate; 
 a first true-ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor and at a first edge of said semiconductor; 
 a source interconnect metal contacting said first true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a second true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor at a second edge of said semiconductor opposite said first edge; 
 a drain interconnect metal contacting said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a high barrier surround gate contacting said semiconductor between said first true-ohmic contact metal and said second true-ohmic contact metal; and 
 a gate interconnect metal contacting said semiconductor and said high barrier surround gate.

all_claims:
An OMESFET comprising:
 a substrate; 
 an organic semiconductor contacting said substrate; 
 a first true-ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor and at a first edge of said semiconductor; 
 a source interconnect metal contacting said first true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a second true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor at a second edge of said semiconductor opposite said first edge; 
 a drain interconnect metal contacting said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a high barrier surround gate contacting said semiconductor between said first true-ohmic contact metal and said second true-ohmic contact metal; and 
 a gate interconnect metal contacting said semiconductor and said high barrier surround gate.

A method for fabricating a OMESFET comprising:
 providing a substrate; 
 affixing a semiconductor to said substrate; 
 affixing a first true-ohmic contact metal to a first edge of said semiconductor; 
 contacting said first true-ohmic contact metal with a source interconnect metal; 
 affixing a second true-ohmic contact to a second edge of said semiconductor and opposite said first edge; 
 contacting said second true-ohmic contact metal with a drain interconnect metal; 
 affixing a high barrier surround gate to said semiconductor between said first true-ohmic contact metal and said second true-ohmic contact metal and 
 contacting said semiconductor and said high barrier surround gate with a gate interconnect metal.

A video display comprising an EL device and integrally fabricated address and logic devices for controlling said EL device, wherein said EL device comprises:
 an EL material; 
 a interconnect metal contacting said EL material; 
 a true-ohmic injection contact contacting said EL material and said interconnect metal; and 
 a hole injection barrier contact which contacts said EL material; and 
 wherein said EL device further comprises at least one OMESFET comprising:
 a substrate; 
 an organic semiconductor contacting said substrate; 
 a first true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor and at a first edge of said semiconductor; 
 a second true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor at a second edge of said semiconductor opposite said first edge; 
 a high barrier surround gate contacting said semiconductor between said first true-ohmic contact metal and said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a source interconnect metal contacting said first true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a drain interconnect metal contacting said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 and 
 a gate interconnect metal contacting said semiconductor and said high barrier surround gate.

A method for fabricating a video display comprising an EL device and integrally fabricated address and logic devices for controlling said EL device, the method comprising the steps of:
 providing an organic EL material; 
 interconnecting a metal contacting said EL material; 
 contacting said EL material and said interconnect metal with a true-ohmic injection contact; and 
 contacting said EL material with a hole injection barrier; and 
 wherein said EL device further comprises at least one OMESFET comprising:
 a substrate; 
 an organic semiconductor contacting said substrate; 
 a first true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor and at a first edge of said semiconductor; 
 a second true ohmic contact metal contacting said semiconductor at a second edge of said semiconductor opposite said first edge; 
 a high barrier surround gate contacting said semiconductor between said first true-ohmic contact metal and said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a source interconnect metal contacting said first true-ohmic contact metal; 
 a drain interconnect metal contacting said second true-ohmic contact metal; 
 and 
 a gate interconnect metal contacting said semiconductor and said high barrier surround gate.
